# Ubuntu White Disk Health Model

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    D[Physical Storage Device] --> S[SMART / NVMe / SCSI / Driver Health]
    S --> N[Normalized Device Health]
    N --> C1[Sense Copy 1]
    N --> C2[Sense Copy 2]
    N --> C3[Sense Copy 3]
    C1 --> F1[File Verification]
    C2 --> F2[File Verification]
    C3 --> F3[File Verification]
    F1 --> R[COMB Report]
    F2 --> R
    F3 --> R
```

```mermaid
classDiagram
    class DiskHealth {
      state
      temperature
      power_on_hours
      read_errors
      write_errors
      wear
      read_latency
      write_latency
      flush_latency
      sampled_at
    }
    class FileSenseHealth {
      file_identity
      copy_1_to_3
      content_ok
      metadata_ok
      blocks_checked
      read_errors_observed
      checksum_failures
      sampled_at
    }
    DiskHealth "1" <-- "0..*" FileSenseHealth
```
